  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inclusive Governance of Senegal River Basin</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this IDF grant will be to move forward and identify ways through a cooperative legal framework will be established to facilitate the joint and inclusive governance of the shared water resource - the Senegal river. The present project facilitates the establisment of a common, inclusive platform for legal dialogue and exchange between the riparian countries with the overall aim being enhanced governance and management of the river through a basin organization which will include all four riparian nations. NB : this AIS is created in advance before the grant approval in order to benefit from the BB budget which is already allocated.</narrative>
  </description>
